# Bibliography and local sources (PFE report)

## Download-before-cite

Every `\cite{...}` in the report **must** have a file saved under `reference/sources/` **before** the citation is added.

- **Storage:** `reference/sources/{citekey}.pdf` (preferred)
- **BibTeX:** `biblio.bib` entry must include `file = {reference/sources/{citekey}.pdf}`
- If a source cannot be downloaded and checked, **do not cite it**

## Current scope

Chapter~2 (`chap_02.tex`) uses a **minimal verified set** (GoEmotions, Transformer stack, HAN, NRC, SenticNet). Other chapters should gain citations only as PDFs are added — do not restore the old bulk `biblio.bib` blindly.

## Re-enable checklist

Bibliography printing is active in `main.tex` / `tpl/isipfe.cls`. Adding new keys requires the PDF + bib entry first.

## Report text

Never mention Cursor rules or download policy in `.tex` files.
